# Security policy

## Reporting a vulnerability

Please report security issues privately through GitHub's
[private vulnerability reporting](https://github.com/{{ owner }}/{{ repo_name }}/security/advisories/new),
not in a public issue. Include what you found, how to reproduce it, and the
impact you expect.

You should get a first response within a week. Fixes are released as soon as
practical and credited in the release notes unless you ask otherwise.

## Supported versions

Only the latest release receives security fixes.
